/div></li></ul></div>\n</div></section></section>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color pi-collapse pi-collapse-closed\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Technical</h2><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"uid\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-label\">UID</div></h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-data\"><code>S_CAMP_MizorasPact_Devil02</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_CAMP_MizorasPact_Devil02+type:localcharacter%2Cglobalcharacter%2Ccharactertemplate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_CAMP_MizorasPact_Devil02+type:localcharacter%2Cglobalcharacter%2Ccharactertemplate\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div></div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"uuid\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-label\">UUID</div></h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-data\"><code>24440f3b-5977-4c4a-b97e-2415a2b533fa</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:24440f3b-5977-4c4a-b97e-2415a2b533fa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:24440f3b-5977-4c4a-b97e-2415a2b533fa\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div></div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"stats\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-label\">Stats</div></h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-data\"><code>Cambion</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Cambion+type:statscharacter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Cambion+type:statscharacter\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div></div>\n</div></section></aside>\n<b>Arbiter Feena</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Cambion\" title=\"Cambion\">cambion</a> in service of the Archdevil <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Zariel\" title=\"Zariel\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Portrait_Zariel.png/25px-Portrait_Zariel.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Portrait_Zariel.png/38px-Portrait_Zariel.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Portrait_Zariel.png/50px-Portrait_Zariel.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Zariel\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Portrait_Zariel.png/25px-Portrait_Zariel.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Portrait_Zariel.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Zariel\" title=\"Zariel\">Zariel</a>, working closely with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mizora\" title=\"Mizora\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/77/Portrait_Mizora.png/25px-Portrait_Mizora.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/77/Portrait_Mizora.png/38px-Portrait_Mizora.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/77/Portrait_Mizora.png/50px-Portrait_Mizora.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mizora\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/77/Portrait_Mizora.png/25px-Portrait_Mizora.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/77/Portrait_Mizora.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mizora\" title=\"Mizora\">Mizora</a>. \n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Involvement\">Involvement</span></h2>\n<p>Feena, a <i>Sister of Justice</i>, appears alongside <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cirrus\" title=\"Cirrus\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6e/Portrait_Cirrus.png/25px-Portrait_Cirrus.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6e/Portrait_Cirrus.png/38px-Portrait_Cirrus.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6e/Portrait_Cirrus.png/50px-Portrait_Cirrus.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Arbiter Cirrus\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6e/Portrait_Cirrus.png/25px-Portrait_Cirrus.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6e/Portrait_Cirrus.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Cirrus\" title=\"Cirrus\">Arbiter Cirrus</a> when summoned by Mizora during a camp event. She and Feena are present to witness one of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wyll\" title=\"Wyll\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6d/Portrait_Wyll.png/25px-Portrait_Wyll.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6d/Portrait_Wyll.png/38px-Portrait_Wyll.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6d/Portrait_Wyll.png/50px-Portrait_Wyll.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wyll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6d/Portrait_Wyll.png/25px-Portrait_Wyll.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6d/Portrait_Wyll.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wyll\" title=\"Wyll\">Wyll</a> and Mizora's pact negotiations: the signing of an infernal contract to save <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ulder_Ravengard\" title=\"Ulder Ravengard\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d9/Portrait_Ulder_Ravengard.png/25px-Portrait_Ulder_Ravengard.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d9/Portrait_Ulder_Ravengard.png/38px-Portrait_Ulder_Ravengard.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d9/Portrait_Ulder_Ravengard.png/50px-Portrait_Ulder_Ravengard.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duke Ravengard's\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d9/Portrait_Ulder_Ravengard.png/25px-Portrait_Ulder_Ravengard.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d9/Portrait_Ulder_Ravengard.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ulder_Ravengard\" title=\"Ulder Ravengard\">Duke Ravengard's</a> life, at the cost of Wyll's eternal servitude to Mizora and Zariel.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Related_quests\">Related quests</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rescue_the_Grand_Duke\" title=\"Rescue the Grand Duke\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Rescue the Grand Duke\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title